<Section Title="How to Play">
    <SubSection Title="Core Mechanic — Winter's Orbs">
        <Explanation>
            <p>
                Rime is a ranged spellcaster who builds up to five <strong>Winter's Orbs</strong> with
                <SpellLink Spell="Spells.FrostBolt" />, <SpellLink Spell="Spells.ColdSnap" />,
                <SpellLink Spell="Spells.FreezingTorrent" /> and <SpellLink Spell="Spells.BurstingIce" />,
                then spends them on <SpellLink Spell="Spells.GlacialBlast" /> (single target) or
                <SpellLink Spell="Spells.IceComet" /> (AoE). Hold at five orbs — overcapping wastes generation.
            </p>
        </Explanation>
        <TipBox Variant="TipBoxVariant.Note" Title="Winter's Embrace">
            While <SpellLink Spell="Spells.BurstingIce" /> is active on an enemy you gain Winter's Embrace,
            dealing 20% more damage for 3 seconds. Fit your spenders inside that window.
        </TipBox>
    </SubSection>

    <SubSection Title="Single-Target Priority">
        <ol>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.WintersBlessing" /> / <SpellLink Spell="Spells.FlightOfTheNavir" /> / <SpellLink Spell="Spells.IceBlitz" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.BurstingIce" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.FreezingTorrent" /> when you have no orbs</li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.GlacialBlast" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.ColdSnap" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.FrostBolt" /></li>
        </ol>
    </SubSection>

    <SubSection Title="AoE Priority (3+ targets)">
        <ol>
            <li>Pre-stack 1-2x <SpellLink Spell="Spells.ColdSnap" /> on the gather</li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.WintersBlessing" /> / <SpellLink Spell="Spells.FlightOfTheNavir" /> / <SpellLink Spell="Spells.IceBlitz" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.FreezingTorrent" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.BurstingIce" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.ColdSnap" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.IceComet" /></li>
            <li><SpellLink Spell="Spells.FrostBolt" /></li>
        </ol>
    </SubSection>

    <SubSection Title="Bread &amp; Butter Combos">
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Single target:</strong> <SpellLink Spell="Spells.BurstingIce" /> → <SpellLink Spell="Spells.GlacialBlast" /> → <SpellLink Spell="Spells.ColdSnap" /></li>
            <li><strong>AoE:</strong> build orbs → <SpellLink Spell="Spells.BurstingIce" /> → <SpellLink Spell="Spells.IceComet" /> → <SpellLink Spell="Spells.IceComet" /> → <SpellLink Spell="Spells.ColdSnap" /></li>
        </ul>
    </SubSection>

    <TipBox Variant="TipBoxVariant.Info" Title="Source">
        Adapted from the community
        <a href="https://www.method.gg/fellowship/heroes/rime/playstyle-and-rotation" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">method.gg Rime guide</a>.
    </TipBox>
</Section>
